<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1091] Node start from sources failed</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1091</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;after successfully compiling v1.2.0 (mvn clean package -DskipTests)&lt;br/&gt;
I get the following error message when trying to start ignite (bin/ignite.sh):&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;java.lang.NoClassDefFoundError: org/eclipse/jetty/http/HttpGenerator$CachedHttpField&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Version v1.1.0 works without any issues following the same steps.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
