                            <comment id="14638515" author="avinogradov" created="Thu, 23 Jul 2015 09:03:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We had different jetty version inside Ignite modules. This affects on class loading.&lt;br/&gt;
org/eclipse/jetty/http/HttpGenerator$CachedHttpField exist only at jetty 9.2.*, so every dependency on jetty now have same version.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
